.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/256879331/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Sports"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":"full","dev":["Chuhai Labs"],"pub":["Thunderful Publishing"],"released":"Aug 18, 2022","meta":80,"langs":["English","French","Italian","German","Spanish - Spain","Japanese","Korean","Simplified Chinese","Portuguese - Brazil","Russian"],"min":[["OS","Windows 7, 8"],["Processor","2.4 GHz Dual Core"],["Memory","4 GB RAM"],["Graphics","GeForce GTX 960 / Radeon R9 380 or better"],["Storage","4 GB available space"]],"rec":[["OS","Windows 10"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"After a freak accident on the verge of winning an international tournament, a golfer lands in Golf Purgatory, and the only way back to the living is to play through its courses. This roguelike golf adventure gives you a limited number of shots to finish each hole within par, and failing sends you back to the start of the course.\n\nEach course is overseen by a spectral Legendary Caddie who teaches the mystical rules of the game, and otherworldly power-ups and wild hazards keep every run unpredictable. It is a demanding single-player game that fuses golf with roguelike structure, best for players who enjoy punishing but replayable action. Full controller support."}}